0 A small three-wheeled exploration rover has a bubble cockpit, chunky wheels and corrugated hoses along its sides.
0 Name: HOSE_FLEXIBLE_12L-Constraints.ldr
0 Author: Holly Wood
0 Unofficial Model
0 // Scene: The rounded canopy dominates a low, angular chassis. Three exposed wheels spread around it, while blue and yellow ribbed hoses climb from the front edges toward equipment behind the cockpit.
0 // Rigid construction: 30324 wheels connect to a System-and-Technic chassis with liftarms, axle pins and towball pins. Slopes, clips, grilles, an antenna and the 30083 hinged dome supply the vehicle detail.
0 // Build lesson: Make an industrial rover recognizable through wheel stance, cockpit volume and an equipment cluster; route hoses around that composition instead of filling every surface with detail.
0 // Reuse: 3020a.dat is missing locally. Inspect all wheel mounts, canopy clearance and hose-end fittings in a complete dependency-resolved model before adapting the chassis.
0 ROTATION CENTER 0 0 0 1 "Custom" 
0 ROTATION CONFIG 0 0
